{"seq":1,"slug":"landed-cost-component-build","title":"落地价构成与计算口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/landed-cost-estimation/landed-cost-component-build","wordCount":2741,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"落地价构成与计算口径\">落地价构成与计算口径</h1><p>一个报关员和一个销售运营看到同一笔订单，会算出两个不同的数字，而且两个都没错。销售看到的是 <code>商品价 + 运费 + 预估税费 = 买家应付</code>；报关员看到的是 <code>完税价格 × 关税税率 + (完税价格 + 关税) × 进口增值税率 = 应向海关缴纳的金额</code>。这两个式子的差别不在算术，而在「完税价格」这个中间量——它既不是售价，也不是成本，而是海关规则下对进口货物应税价值的一个法律定义。落地价工程化的第一件事，是把这两个式子之间的每个符号对齐，让同一笔订单在销售侧、财务侧和海关侧指向同一组事实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>完税价格不等于售价</strong>：它是海关规则下对货物应税价值的法律定义，由成交价加计与扣除调整项得出；成交价不被接受时，海关按协定顺序改用其他估价方法。</li>\n<li><strong>关税与进口增值税是串联而非并联</strong>：增值税以「完税价格 + 关税 + 消费税」为基数，把两项写成并联相加会系统性低估高关税品类的税负。</li>\n<li><strong>CIF 与 FOB 是两条税基口径</strong>：前者把运抵进口地前的运费与保险计入，后者不计入，必须按目的地国家配置，而非全局统一。</li>\n<li><strong>一次计算一份快照</strong>：全部输入与中间量冻结存储，结账页、订单页与客服后台都读同一份快照，口径争议才可复算。</li>\n<li><strong>本 hub 与 042 的分界</strong>：本 hub 决定向买家展示什么，042 决定向税务机关申报什么，两者共享输入但不共享输出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"落地价的五项构成\">落地价的五项构成</h2><p>落地价（landed cost）的通说是「商品成本加上把它送到目的地所发生的一切费用」，一般包括货价、运费、保险、进口关税与其他费用（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Landed_cost\">Wikipedia: Landed cost</a>）。跨境电商场景里需要把它拆得更细，因为每一项的<strong>承担者</strong>和<strong>可预估性</strong>都不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"货价-三种价格三个用途\">货价：三种价格三个用途</h3><p>一件商品在系统里至少有三种价格形态，混用是口径错误的头号来源。<strong>商品标价</strong>是页面上展示的、含平台加价的零售价；<strong>成交价</strong>（price actually paid or payable）是买家实际支付的、扣除优惠后的金额；<strong>完税价格</strong>（customs value）是成交价经调整后用于计税的金额。WTO 估价协定把成交价定义为「货物出口到进口国销售时实际支付或应付的价格」，它是第一顺位的估价基础（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_info_e.htm\">WTO: Customs Valuation</a>）。三者关系是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>paid</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>Article 8</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>post-import</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{customs}} = P_{\\text{paid}} + A_{\\text{Article 8}} - E_{\\text{post-import}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Article 8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">post-import</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>Article 8</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{Article 8}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Article 8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是应计入成交价的调整项，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>post-import</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{post-import}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">post-import</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是进口后发生的、不应计入的费用。这个式子是国际协定层面的定义，因此是跨国口径对齐的安全基准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"运费与保险-何时计入\">运费与保险：何时计入</h3><p>运费是否计入完税价格是各国实践差异最大的一项。CIF 口径的国家（欧盟、中国等多数国家）把货物运抵进口地之前的运费与保险费加入完税价格；FOB 口径的国家（美国、澳大利亚等）不加入。同一场「免运费」促销因此在两个市场对税基影响完全不同——在 CIF 国家，平台自己承担的运费没有省税，反而抬高了税基。判断规则是<strong>看这笔费用发生在进口地之前还是之后</strong>：国际干线运费、出口报关前的内陆运输、货运保险属于前者；进口清关后到门的末端配送属于后者。</p>\n<h3 id=\"清关服务费与中介费\">清关服务费与中介费</h3><p>报关行的申报服务费、承运商的垫资手续费、海关系统数据交换费，都是平台向服务方支付的运营成本，不计入完税价格（它们是进口后发生的服务对价），但<strong>必须计入卖方的落地成本</strong>。这是两个口径最容易打架的地方：它们不抬税基，但抬成本。成本模型（见 <a href=\"../ddp-experience-ops/ddp-margin-cost-model\">DDP 定价与成本建模</a>）必须把它们单列。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关税与进口环节税\">关税与进口环节税</h3><p>关税按完税价格以从价、从量或复合方式计征，税率由 HS 编码加原产国共同决定。进口环节增值税在多数辖区以「完税价格 + 关税 + 应纳消费税」为基数计征，因此与关税是<strong>串联</strong>关系而非并联：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>import</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>关税</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>消费税</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>VAT</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{import}} = V_{\\text{customs}} \\cdot r_{\\text{duty}} + (V_{\\text{customs}} + \\text{关税} + \\text{消费税}) \\cdot r_{\\text{VAT}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">import</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">关税</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消费税</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">VAT</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把两项写成并联相加，是跨境计税里最常见的错误——它会系统性低估高关税品类的税负。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率的时点\">汇率的时点</h3><p>跨境税费的双方币种不同，汇率时点决定金额。可复现的做法是<strong>在计算时刻冻结一个汇率并随快照存储</strong>，而不是读账时用当时汇率重算。冻结之后，任何口径争议都能回到那份快照复算。汇率通常有两种口径：市场展示汇率与海关公布的申报汇率，后者在部分辖区按月更新，用于正式申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报关价不等于售价\">报关价不等于售价</h2><h3 id=\"加计项与扣除项的清单化\">加计项与扣除项的清单化</h3><p>差异来源有三类：应当加计而漏计的、不应加计却加了、以及价格本身不可接受的。前两类可以做成静态清单，由系统在生成快照时逐项判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调整项</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>买方无偿提供的协助（模具、设计、工程）</td>\n<td>加计</td>\n<td>有非现金投入且用于生产该批货物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与货物相关的特许权使用费</td>\n<td>加计</td>\n<td>该支付是进口销售的条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装与容器成本</td>\n<td>加计</td>\n<td>未含在发票价内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>除购货佣金外的佣金与经纪费</td>\n<td>加计</td>\n<td>发票未单列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口后运输、安装、施工</td>\n<td>不计入</td>\n<td>费用发生在进口地之后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口关税本身</td>\n<td>不计入</td>\n<td>关税不是完税价格的组成部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买方自付的非强制检验费</td>\n<td>不计入</td>\n<td>非海关要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>清单化的价值在于把「申报价该填多少」从一个人的判断变成一次可测试的函数调用，并让每次加成都有据可查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成交价被拒绝时的替代方法\">成交价被拒绝时的替代方法</h3><p>后一类差异（价格本身不可接受：买卖双方关联且关系影响价格、交易附有无法量化的条件、货物并非以出口到进口国为唯一目的而销售）触发的是替代估价，而不是加加减减。海关必须按协定规定的顺序改用其他方法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[申报的成交价] --&gt; B{条件是否满足}&#10;  B --&gt;|出口销售真实&lt;br/&gt;无未量化条件&lt;br/&gt;非关联影响价格| C[接受为成交价]&#10;  B --&gt;|任一不满足| D[相同货物成交价]&#10;  D --&gt;|不可得| E[类似货物成交价]&#10;  E --&gt;|不可得| F[扣除法 或 计算法&lt;br/&gt;进口商可请求调换顺序]&#10;  F --&gt;|不可得| G[合理方法 基于进口国可得数据]&#10;  C --&gt; H[加成调整后得完税价格]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[申报的成交价] --&gt; B{条件是否满足}\n  B --&gt;|出口销售真实&lt;br/&gt;无未量化条件&lt;br/&gt;非关联影响价格| C[接受为成交价]\n  B --&gt;|任一不满足| D[相同货物成交价]\n  D --&gt;|不可得| E[类似货物成交价]\n  E --&gt;|不可得| F[扣除法 或 计算法&lt;br/&gt;进口商可请求调换顺序]\n  F --&gt;|不可得| G[合理方法 基于进口国可得数据]\n  C --&gt; H[加成调整后得完税价格]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>扣除法以进口国转售价倒扣费用得出，计算法以生产成本加合理利润构建；两者的先后顺序只在进口商主动请求时可以调换。工程含义是：<strong>平台预估用的完税价格永远只是候选值，海关有权改判</strong>——这个「改判可能性」是下一章差异归因的核心输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算的可复现性-一次计算一份快照\">计算的可复现性：一次计算一份快照</h2><p>落地价计算横跨多个随时间变化的外部输入：税率表、汇率、运费报价、门槛规则。若每次展示都现算，同一笔订单会在结账页、订单详情页和客服后台显示三个数字，且无法解释差异。正确做法是<strong>每次计算产出一份不可变快照</strong>，包含全部输入与中间量，后续展示都读快照。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;calc_id&quot;: &quot;lc_9f3c2a1b&quot;,&#10;  &quot;computed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T10:12:44Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;inputs&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;hs_code&quot;: &quot;6403.99&quot;,&#10;    &quot;origin_country&quot;: &quot;CN&quot;,&#10;    &quot;dest_country&quot;: &quot;PT&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paid_amount&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 79.0, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot; },&#10;    &quot;intl_freight&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: 6.3, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot; },&#10;    &quot;fx_to_customs_ccy&quot;: { &quot;EUR&quot;: 1.0, &quot;locked_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;valuation&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;CIF&quot;, &quot;customs_value&quot;: 85.3, &quot;adjustments&quot;: [], &quot;rejected_reason&quot;: null },&#10;  &quot;tax&quot;: { &quot;duty_rate&quot;: 0.08, &quot;duty_amount&quot;: 6.82, &quot;vat_rate&quot;: 0.23, &quot;vat_amount&quot;: 21.19, &quot;total_tax&quot;: 28.01 },&#10;  &quot;landed_price&quot;: 113.31,&#10;  &quot;confidence&quot;: &quot;high&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"calc_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lc_9f3c2a1b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"computed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T10:12:44Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hs_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"6403.99\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"origin_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dest_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paid_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">79.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"intl_freight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fx_to_customs_ccy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"locked_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"valuation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CIF\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"customs_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"adjustments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rejected_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duty_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"duty_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.82</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"vat_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"vat_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21.19</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total_tax\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"landed_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">113.31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"confidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>快照里的 <code>confidence</code> 字段是下一篇的主角——这里先埋下接口。快照的另一个作用是把「口径」变成可审计的数据：任何一次口径争议都可以通过比对数份快照定位到是哪个字段的取值规则变了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与后台税费引擎的接口契约\">与后台税费引擎的接口契约</h2><p>本 hub 处理买家侧口径，后台那台承担多市场税率计算与电子发票生成的引擎在 <a href=\"../../tax-invoicing-engine-global/\">042 税费计算与电子发票引擎</a>——注意边界：<strong>本 hub 决定「向买家展示什么」，042 决定「向税务机关申报什么」</strong>。两者共享同一份输入，但不共享同一份输出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[购物车与地址] --&gt; B[归类服务 得到 HS 与原产国]&#10;  B --&gt; C[落地价计算 快照生成]&#10;  C --&gt; D{门槛与交货模式判定}&#10;  D --&gt;|DDP 含税| E[向买家展示含税总价]&#10;  D --&gt;|DDU 到付| F[展示净价 与 到付提示]&#10;  C --&gt; G[税费引擎 042 正式计算]&#10;  G --&gt; H[申报数据与发票]&#10;  E --&gt; I[下单 预收税费]&#10;  F --&gt; J[清关时由买家缴纳]&#10;  I --&gt; K[差异对账]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n  A[购物车与地址] --&gt; B[归类服务 得到 HS 与原产国]\n  B --&gt; C[落地价计算 快照生成]\n  C --&gt; D{门槛与交货模式判定}\n  D --&gt;|DDP 含税| E[向买家展示含税总价]\n  D --&gt;|DDU 到付| F[展示净价 与 到付提示]\n  C --&gt; G[税费引擎 042 正式计算]\n  G --&gt; H[申报数据与发票]\n  E --&gt; I[下单 预收税费]\n  F --&gt; J[清关时由买家缴纳]\n  I --&gt; K[差异对账]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>接口的核心约定是：落地价服务向税费引擎传递<strong>原始输入</strong>（HS、原产国、成交价、运费、目的地、税号），而不是自己的中间结果。反过来，税费引擎在正式申报后回写<strong>实际税单</strong>，落地价服务用它校准下一次预估。这条回写通道就是 <a href=\"../duty-variance-reconcile/estimate-vs-actual-variance\">预估与实际税费差异</a> 的数据来源。若让落地价服务把算好的税额直接传给引擎，两个口径就会互相污染，后续无法归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"口径对齐清单\">口径对齐清单</h2><p>上线前逐项确认下表，可以把大部分「三个数字对不上」的问题挡在门外。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>销售侧口径</th>\n<th>海关侧口径</th>\n<th>对齐要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计价基础</td>\n<td>买家支付金额</td>\n<td>成交价加成调整项</td>\n<td>快照中同时存原始值与调整项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费</td>\n<td>计入买家应付</td>\n<td>取决于 CIF/FOB</td>\n<td>按目的地国家配置开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险</td>\n<td>通常忽略</td>\n<td>CIF 国家计入</td>\n<td>有货运险时必须传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关税</td>\n<td>单个税率</td>\n<td>HS × 原产国</td>\n<td>归类结果需版本化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口增值税</td>\n<td>含税或到付</td>\n<td>关税后串联计征</td>\n<td>严禁并联相加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率</td>\n<td>展示汇率</td>\n<td>申报汇率</td>\n<td>分别冻结，分别可审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛判定</td>\n<td>是否含税显示</td>\n<td>是否简化征收</td>\n<td>同一份规则模块输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务费</td>\n<td>计入成本</td>\n<td>不计税基</td>\n<td>成本模型中单列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中「门槛判定」一行指向第三篇与 <a href=\"deminimis-threshold-ioss-dmp-link\">小额免税门槛与代收通道衔接</a>：门槛规则既决定前台是否显示含税价，也决定后台走哪条申报通道。交货模式的选择则决定表中前几项口径最终对买家可见还是被平台吸收——见 <a href=\"../ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion\">DDP 与 DDU 的模式选择</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>口径对齐的落点是三件事，缺一件就会出现「三个数字对不上」。第一，<strong>把完税价格与售价显式区分</strong>，并把每一项调整都留痕，因为海关质疑时需要举证。第二，<strong>把 CIF/FOB、汇率时点、门槛粒度做成按目的地的配置</strong>，而不是散落在各处的条件分支。第三，<strong>让落地价计算产出不可变快照</strong>，并把实际税单通过一条独立通道回写，供下一轮预估校准。</p>\n<p>这三件事的顺序不能颠倒：没有快照，归因与回写都无从谈起；没有配置化的口径，快照里的数字也就不具备跨市场可比性。落地价算准之后，下一个问题是这个数字在买家面前有多可信，见 <a href=\"front-estimate-confidence-badge\">前台预估精度与可信度展示</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"落地价构成与计算口径","id":"落地价构成与计算口径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"落地价的五项构成","id":"落地价的五项构成"},{"level":3,"text":"货价：三种价格三个用途","id":"货价-三种价格三个用途"},{"level":3,"text":"运费与保险：何时计入","id":"运费与保险-何时计入"},{"level":3,"text":"清关服务费与中介费","id":"清关服务费与中介费"},{"level":3,"text":"关税与进口环节税","id":"关税与进口环节税"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率的时点","id":"汇率的时点"},{"level":2,"text":"报关价不等于售价","id":"报关价不等于售价"},{"level":3,"text":"加计项与扣除项的清单化","id":"加计项与扣除项的清单化"},{"level":3,"text":"成交价被拒绝时的替代方法","id":"成交价被拒绝时的替代方法"},{"level":2,"text":"计算的可复现性：一次计算一份快照","id":"计算的可复现性-一次计算一份快照"},{"level":2,"text":"与后台税费引擎的接口契约","id":"与后台税费引擎的接口契约"},{"level":2,"text":"口径对齐清单","id":"口径对齐清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"前台预估精度与可信度展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/landed-cost-estimation/front-estimate-confidence-badge"}}